# ---- Python bytecode / caches ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/

# ---- Scratch directories ----
# tools/verify_published.py downloads wheels into the system temp dir; these
# patterns are here in case an older revision (or a hand-run) leaves one behind
# in the working tree. Without them, 17 such directories were committed by
# accident once already.
pubverify-*/
pubx-*/
pubaudit-*/
failclosed-*/
failclosed-x-*/
.guard-for-parity/

# ---- Downloaded artifacts ----
# The verification tools pull released wheels from PyPI in order to test them. They
# unpack into the system temp dir, but a hand-run `pip download` or a one-off script
# can drop the .whl itself here, where it looks like a file worth committing. It is
# build output: reproducible from PyPI on demand, and stale the moment a release
# moves on. Two such files were sitting untracked in this repository.
*.whl
*.tar.gz

# ---- Editor / OS junk ----
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
# Scratch space for the verification tools when the system temp directory is not writable.
.phoc-scratch/

# Scratch space for the verification tools (system temp may be unwritable).
.phocinae-verify/
.phoc-scratch/
